ntent systems into Sanity. Use when migrating or replatforming to Sanity from AEM, Adobe Experience Manager, Contentful, Strapi, Webflow, WordPress, Payload, Drupal, Markdown/MDX/frontmatter files, WXR/XML exports, CMS APIs, database dumps, static HTML, or when designing extraction, transformation, Portable Text conversion, asset migration, redirects, validation, and cutover workflows.","headings":["Sanity Migration","Required Workflow","Deliverables to Produce","Defaults","Sanity Guardrails","Stop and Ask","Do Not Do This","Reference Map"],"name_hint":"sanity · migration"},{"path":"skills/seo-aeo-best-practices/SKILL.md","name":"seo-aeo-best-practices","description":"SEO and AEO best practices for metadata, Open Graph, sitemaps, robots.txt, hreflang, JSON-LD structured data, EEAT, and content optimized for search engines and AI answer surfaces. Use this skill when implementing page SEO, technical SEO, schema markup, international SEO, AI-overview readiness, or improving content for Google, ChatGPT, Perplexity, and similar assistants.","headings":["SEO & AEO Best Practices","When to Apply","Core Concepts","SEO (Search Engine Optimization)","AEO (Answer Engine Optimization)","EEAT (Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, Trustworthiness)","References"],"name_hint":"seo · aeo · best · practices"}],"commands":[{"path":"commands/deploy-schema.md","name":"deploy-schema","description":"Deploy Sanity schema to the Content Lake with verification.","headings":["Deploy Sanity Schema","Why Deploy Schema?","Deployment Command","What I'll Do","When to Deploy","Important Notes","Usage"]},{"path":"commands/sanity-review.md","name":"sanity-review","description":"Review code for Sanity best practices and common issues.","headings":["Sanity Code Review","Schema Review","Query Review","Frontend Review","Usage"]},{"path":"commands/sanity.md","name":"sanity","description":"Lists available Sanity skills and help topics.","headings":["Sanity AI Helper"]},{"path":"commands/typegen.md","n